{"id":"658974","name":"青椒炒茄子","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/658974/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"茄子","amount":"1根"},{"name":"青椒","amount":"5个"},{"name":"猪肉","amount":"150g"}],"sub":[{"name":"蒜","amount":"4瓣"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"茄子、青椒。","img":"images/658974/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"茄子切薄片，撒上盐软化20分钟，再用清水洗去咸味，攥干水分。","img":"images/658974/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"青椒切小块。","img":"images/658974/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"肥瘦相间的猪肉切片。","img":"images/658974/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"蒜拍扁。","img":"images/658974/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"用酱油、蚝油、豆瓣酱、淀粉、胡椒粉加入半碗清水，拌一个酱汁备用。","img":"images/658974/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"起锅热油，倒入猪肉。","img":"images/658974/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"猪肉炒至干香后放入蒜瓣。","img":"images/658974/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"蒜炒出香气。","img":"images/658974/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"倒入茄子翻炒2分钟。","img":"images/658974/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"加入半碗清水，焖2分钟。","img":"images/658974/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"开盖后倒入青椒。","img":"images/658974/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"青椒炒至断生。","img":"images/658974/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"倒入酱汁。","img":"images/658974/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"大火收汁至浓稠，出锅。","img":"images/658974/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/658974/step_16.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}